Troubleshooting:

Common Issues:

1. API Key not found
   Run: export OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here

2. Configuration file missing
   Run: paladin init to create default config

3. Redis connection failed
   Check: docker-compose up -d redis

For more help:
  Documentation: https://docs.paladin.rs
  Issues: https://github.com/DF3NDR/paladin/issues
